# Supermart environment variables
# This repository ships a single Next.js app at frontend/apps/web.
# Use the app-level environment template at frontend/apps/web/.env.example
# as the canonical reference for local development and deployment.

# Example: copy the template into the app folder and edit values
#
#   cd frontend/apps/web
#   Copy-Item .env.example .env.local

# (The previous split frontend/backend env layout is deprecated.)

# --------------------------------------------
# NOTES FOR VERCEL DEPLOYMENT
# --------------------------------------------
# 1. Create a single Vercel project with Root Directory set to: frontend/apps/web
# 2. Add the following environment variables in Vercel:
#    AUTH_URL="https://modern-mart-gamma.vercel.app"
#    NEXTAUTH_URL="https://modern-mart-gamma.vercel.app"
